      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FLYING HUGO (1) is in top form lately including a head turning win at this track in 17.42 two back then backing it up with a 17.39 victory at this track over 305m latest. In form and looks the one to beat again. TRIAL KING (4) is progressing well scoring last time out (17.51) at this track and bringing up his 14th career win. Has a strong winning record here at this journey. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to his credit. Should be in this for a long way. SOMETHING GOOD (2) jumped from the inside and boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten 0.8 lengths (17.55) behind TRIAL KING at this track. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Expected to be in this for a long way. HUNTSMAN (6) profiles nicely over this trip.",
